sequenceDiagram
  participant Cli as Client
  participant Fa as Facade
  participant Leg as COBOL (reference)
  participant Sh as Shadow comparer
  participant New as .NET 10 (candidate)
  Cli->>Fa: calculate fee
  Fa->>Leg: request
  Leg-->>Fa: authoritative result
  Fa-->>Cli: the reference answers
  Fa-)Sh: enqueues request and result
  Sh->>New: same request
  New-->>Sh: candidate result
  Sh->>Sh: compares and records the discrepancy
